# In a reordered Today view, an entry that leaves passes the focus to the row below it.
# BUG: focus goes to the next block in document order (C) instead of the next row in the view (A).
file <<END
- A @due({today})
- B @due({today})
- C @due({today})
END
keys gt j <A-k>
see ▌ - B
keys W
hide - B
see ▌ - A
